# Example Co

> Example Co publishes invoicing software documentation for small teams. This file lists the pages most useful to AI agents and developer tools.

Each linked page also has a Markdown version at the same URL with .md appended.

## Docs

- [Getting started](https://example.com/docs/getting-started.md): Create an account and send a first invoice
- [API reference](https://example.com/docs/api.md): Endpoints, authentication and error codes

## Policies

- [Pricing](https://example.com/pricing.md): Plans and usage limits
- [Privacy policy](https://example.com/legal/privacy.md)

## Optional

- [Changelog](https://example.com/changelog.md): Release notes by version
